  "prompts": {
    "L1": "Please polish the following text to make it more eloquent and professional, keeping all original information unchanged:\n\nThis paper has been removed by arXiv administrators because it plagiarizes gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, and others.   This paper also has excessive overlap with the following papers also written by the authors or their collaborators: gr-qc/0608111, and others.",
    "L2": "Please rewrite the following text in your own words, keeping all original facts but using completely different expressions and sentence structures:\n\nThis paper has been removed by arXiv administrators because it plagiarizes gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, and others.   This paper also has excessive overlap with the following papers also written by the authors or their collaborators: gr-qc/0608111, and others.",
    "L3": "Please expand the following bullet points into a complete, well-structured text:\n\n- The paper was removed by arXiv administrators.\n- The removal was due to plagiarism.\n- The paper plagiarizes content from gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, and other works.\n- The paper also substantially overlaps with gr-qc/0608111 and other papers by the authors or their collaborators.",
    "L4": "Please expand the following two-sentence summary into a complete text:\n\nArXiv administrators reviewed the paper against prior works and identified plagiarism and excessive textual overlap. Consequently, the paper was removed for copying gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, gr-qc/0608111, and other papers, highlighting serious violations of academic integrity.",
    "L5": "Please write a text about the following topic:\n\nKeywords: This"
  },
  "outputs": {
    "L1": "This paper has been removed by arXiv administrators because it plagiarizes material from gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, and other works. It also substantially overlaps with gr-qc/0608111 and other papers authored by the same authors or their collaborators.",
    "L2": "arXiv administrators withdrew this manuscript after determining that it copied material from gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, and additional works. They also found substantial duplication with gr-qc/0608111 and other papers authored by the same researchers or their collaborators.",
    "L3": "The paper was removed by arXiv administrators after concerns about plagiarism were identified. It contains material taken from arXiv submissions gr-qc/0410004 and gr-qc/0603075, as well as from other works. In addition, the paper substantially overlaps with gr-qc/0608111 and with other publications authored by the same researchers or their collaborators.",
    "L4": "ArXiv administrators reviewed the paper and compared its content with previously published works. Their assessment identified substantial textual overlap, including passages that appeared to have been copied without adequate quotation, attribution, or original contribution. As a result, the paper was removed from arXiv for copying material from several earlier submissions, notably gr-qc/0410004, gr-qc/0603075, and gr-qc/0608111, as well as from other papers. The removal underscores the seriousness of plagiarism and excessive reuse of existing text, both of which violate fundamental standards of academic integrity. Researchers are expected to acknowledge sources clearly, distinguish their own contributions from prior work, and obtain permission where necessary when reusing published material.",
    "L5": "## This\n\n“This” is a small word with remarkable flexibility. It can identify an object, introduce an idea, or draw attention to a specific moment: this book, this feeling, this opportunity. Its meaning depends entirely on context, connecting language to what is present, immediate, and relevant.\n\nIn everyday communication, “this” creates focus. It tells the listener or reader, “Pay attention to what is here.” Whether used in conversation, writing, or digital content, this simple word helps make ideas clearer and more direct."
  },
